{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "bbae9deea5a71463d12fc8333725266c8495d73ce0c6736d725705c6fd35bb2e", "ja": "第三幕、開始", "zh": "第三幕，开始", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b904bd3946190b391fa373ebf847a27947c9943343500b8d67f5d7f82f6bb211", "ja": "藍のバックダンサーとしてデビューした真珠\n星となる。真珠星は初めて立ったステージで\nその熱量に当てられ、楽しかったことを痛感\nする。一方その頃、意味深な様子でステージ\nを見ている、神宮寺と一人の少女がいた。", "zh": "以藍的伴舞身份出道的真珠星，\n在第一次登上的舞台上，\n被那股热情所感染，深切体会到\n演出的快乐。与此同时，神宫寺\n和一名少女正意味深长地注视着舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ea490d16922e7d24934485bd2360197d6179b8752b997fa280425c029cbdd4d1", "ja": "（第二幕で、神宮寺は新生I.V.結成のため、\nオーディションで藍のパートナーを決めると宣言）", "zh": "（第二幕中，神宫寺宣布要通过试镜选出藍的搭档，以组建新生『I.V.』）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "413739f2e7c60fdc6f3c72c12c8539e37af92037f21267cb2ce8f2ff3429e5ae", "ja": "（真珠星と、同じく研修生のなるは、\n第一関門であるバックダンサー試験に合格した……）", "zh": "（真珠星和同样是研修生的なる，通过了第一道关卡——伴舞考试……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "deef6ddc4f7bc878b2d98a080d838663f67f4c3fa7edaf3939e76d67eacfa46e", "ja": "笹森藍、ソロステージ公演終盤……", "zh": "笹森蓝个人舞台公演接近尾声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "a362c583cb7135edc0260dfe424e60c165e382bd0c02f1e0020fce0de0858f2d", "ja": "みんなー！！\n今日は来てくれて、本当にありがとう！！", "zh": "大家——！！\n今天真的很感谢大家能来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "9772fa18e53059b344d4adb28217779356dc22194522871e9ebda61f4a24208f", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "766980741e9496cd5ef11dd895019437a716d370113b9e26b5d333a7479e3074", "ja": "すごいステージだったね……。", "zh": "真是场精彩的演出呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "d86d9a5b8be93e4637becd39db0c5aae7f80a92aa8fd0f88c9f68c9594a20a6f", "ja": "すごく緊張しちゃったけど……でも今は、\n私なりに、ちゃんとできた、って思うよ。", "zh": "虽然真的紧张得不得了……不过现在，我觉得自己已经尽力做好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "76bdaa304275667f3980405fe8b9bbce62a0370d9aa60bcf51a161461b46b4b1", "ja": "？　真珠星さん？", "zh": "？真珠星小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "1728204c70c120ea08df7986c06488cae12e4e410ba670ca83ed0ca73e82785c", "ja": "え、あ……なに？", "zh": "诶，啊……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "c911f76e68982401d8de585d70c2c36e987c6741a59d0bd028f6b73559f0b31e", "ja": "どうだった？　初めてのステージは。", "zh": "感觉怎么样？第一次登上舞台的感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "afd626ab28a43067ec955040e2eb482185de3fa3efa04e712b0648422a78647d", "ja": "あっ、藍さん！？　お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，蓝小姐！？辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "ee1293b567a8282df139a3746720977a91b12251e5d4432a23d8edd9f147adb6", "ja": "！　お、お疲れさまです……。", "zh": "！呃、辛苦了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "861cbcbfcfbad35f30cb37117085611aa63345cf62609dbb3ea66c6ed21ad3eb", "ja": "どうしたの？　一宮真珠星。\n……言葉も出ないくらい、感動した？", "zh": "怎么了？一宫真珠星。\n……感动到连话都说不出来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "4269251a210edb12a6e4cf23ceb78bf133c2ee2106c5f1890d8f35fe2ac3499a", "ja": "だ、誰が……！", "zh": "谁、谁说的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "c18f2dd8dcfa849c560b2a4946a1f88ab823d4a571fb1e0222dc7d2e6c546c3c", "ja": "……ま、いいわ。\nみんな、お疲れさま。", "zh": "……算了，无所谓了。\n大家辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "191768f64f33fda65190e21308a9dbf3288afca59ca52a9701f5e22f1aaa4f98", "ja": "それぞれミス、課題、きちんと見直すように。\n惰性で続けられる程、バックダンサーは甘くないわよ。", "zh": "每个人的失误和问题，都要好好重新检查一遍。\n伴舞可不是能靠惯性就一直坚持下去的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "a46a4a9dc27fbbdb0d3a621807a89fa20355b645cef5a4e4807eb8c7bc7754a5", "ja": "（……初めて立った、本物のステージ。\n目が眩みそうなほどキラキラしていて、熱くて）", "zh": "（……第一次站上的，真正的舞台。\n闪耀得让人眼花缭乱，又炽热无比）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "226c9780e7f40b811c683888e8c42ca3e3806f7d7b195438acf1cf089018ecf7", "ja": "（……悔しいけど。楽しかった）", "zh": "（……虽然很不甘心，但很开心）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1019_null", "source_sha256": "9d1e1079d647135a0beea0c562ffbb2737e4b94129cd78fe963d879de4c655ff", "ja": "ライブ終了後……", "zh": "演出结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "03313e99636ebc082fad232e8471ab91b253cd61387fae398d7dae4f5d70bb65", "ja": "……。\nなるほどね、あれが……。", "zh": "……。\n原来如此，那就是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "9e72f7828c42ad811274e4df10886c0ef10500fdac2186f8b1180c13743db53e", "ja": "そう。『I.V.』の片割れ。\nひとりになっても尚、輝き続ける星……。", "zh": "没错。那就是“I.V.”的另一半。\n即使孤身一人，也依然持续闪耀的星星……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "f9e718db768758442651fc1387b50046a077b56b2b2988dcd1dcf33de16e478e", "ja": "どうだった？　笹森藍は。", "zh": "怎么样？笹森蓝如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "bb2a880297939cc819242df25c2da85e281dda25e1217b2fa61eb543e4d004fa", "ja": "まあまあ。\n悪くはないかなって。", "zh": "还行吧。\n我觉得也不算差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "7bc5bddfb75be9e199eb56e6cc3dd55d01d40dfa863aebb4769b988335d234db", "ja": "ふうん？\nお眼鏡に適ったならなによりだわ。", "zh": "哦？\n能入得了您的法眼，那就再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "de9b8cc0954d8e4bc4ac0527443c49ed59a49d145096335a2236dba4bd40f709", "ja": "そうですね。\nせいぜい、利用させてもらいます。", "zh": "是啊。那我就尽量利用一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0341_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_01_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "25111c5c014fca26b2511f5da46ece68d40fa43ba04c630fc14a2a6a5c11e6fb", "ja": "もちろん。\nお互いにとって、いい結果になるよう願っているわ。", "zh": "那是自然。\n希望这对我们双方而言，都能带来不错的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
